The remaining files in code/kvpack/ (the reproducibility, staging, arithmetic,
configuration and validation helpers) and code/launch/configs/ are PLI Labs
supporting code. The upstream patches themselves are obtained separately for a
rebuild and verified against their pinned hashes. Third-party image dependencies
including torch, Triton, FlashInfer, and DeepGEMM are imported by the overlay;
their libraries and binaries are not included in this source distribution.

